														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1476507">
									

<p>There is probably a better example, but I think Scratskinner's point is that the leet speak thing isn't in the original article.</p>
<p>It's something that someone, somewhere, tacked on for a tale or experiment and people ran with it afterwards.</p>
<p>It would be like if someone wrote a tale relating The Factory to the broken god cultists and people ran with the idea that The Factory was just waiting for the return of the missing pieces to bring forth the reforged god.</p>
<p>There's nothing that says they aren't linked and the source material is vague enough to be plausible, but I'm sure it would annoy Bright to see someone reinterpreting his creation that way.</p>

