<p>@ lycan: My point with the whole crosstest thing was that you you need to find one that doesn't involve 732, else the idea of this story's entity plausibly not being 732 falls flat on its face.</p>
<p>On reflection, perhaps I was a bit unfair in criticizing you for the story's lack of Serpent's Hand. After all, you are not the author of the story and can't really do anything about it. For that I apologize. I probably ought to have asked what your backstory was and how you'd have fit it in (or hints to it).</p>
<p>@Theally: Ah, you're good. My apologies if you felt belittled by my refutal of Fred being this story's entity. (Since it was your suggestion really.)</p>
<p>@Hurtz: Technically, not exactly the same. The bit where she reflects on the difficulty of carving an ampersat would also need revision. And getting rid of the leet would necessitate a title change.</p>
<p>@general audience: made edit to previous post to make things clearer.</p>

							</div>

								
					
