														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2233102">
									

<p>Replying a little late to say: there's no SCP-2122 for now, but there surely will be one soon.</p>
<p>There's no actual <em>need</em> to change the number &#8212; it could be assumed that she's been renumbered or exists in a different continuity &#8212; but it <em>could</em> be kind of fun to try to make her work as an actual SCP. :) Or if not, her number <em>could</em> optionally be changed to avoid confusion.</p>
<p>None of this is required, of course.</p>

